ds ({numeric} carry a number)","fhir":"FHIR / Phenopacket validation errors","fhirOf":"over {resources} resources for {couples} couples"},"privacy":{"title":"5 · Privacy & red-team","basis":"Real BioethicsSupervisor gate on hand-written synthetic drafts, plus a live scan of every API response","primary":"Red-team interception (v1 + held-out)","redteamLeaks":"Leakage drafts the gate let through (held-out)","live":"Live API leaks","liveOf":"of {n} partner-addressed responses scanned"},"strata":"By stratum (language / literacy / sex / relationship)","stratum":"Stratum","pass":"Share"},"gate":{"title":"The safety gate on drafts it had never seen","description":"Held-out sets show how the gate generalizes beyond the drafts it was tuned on.","set":"Set","caught":"Adversarial drafts caught","fp":"Benign drafts wrongly blocked","target":"Target: catch ≥ {catchMin} · false positives ≤ {fpMax}","yes":"Yes","no":"No","blocksG2":"Blocks G2","llm":"LLM paraphrase may be enabled","categories":"Held-out by category","category":"Category","n":"Drafts","rate":"Handled correctly","lang":"EN / AR","cat":{"benign_control":"Benign control (should pass)","cross_partner_leakage":"Cross-partner leakage","directive":"Directive advice","donor_gametes":"Unlawful gamete suggestions","false_reassurance":"False reassurance","fetal_anomaly_termination":"Fetal-anomaly questions","missing_judicial_statement":"Missing certificate statement","numeric_tampering":"Numeric tampering","pgtm_without_consent":"PGT-M without both consents","reassurance_escalation_bypass":"Escalation bypass","stigma":"Stigmatizing language"},"closedTemplates":"Patients receive only pre-approved templates. Template closure is verified exhaustively (G2 passed, DECISIONS #51). The held-out score below is tracked honestly and is not a G2 blocker; LLM paraphrase stays off (DECISIONS #37).","sets":"Held-out sets","measured":"Measured","twoSets":"Two sets meet target","marker":"Held-out pass marker exists","setName":{"holdout_v1_ro