ing, shown through LockedNumber; the dashboard does no arithmetic on chances.","calibrationNote":"Clinical calibration against real outcomes is not possible with synthetic data. What this panel shows is (a) how the locked risk values are spread across the synthetic cohort, and (b) agreement with an independent oracle: {mismatches} mismatches over {records} records (DECISIONS #47)."},"tests":{"title":"Test matrix","description":"Per-suite junit results behind the pack; red suites are reported, not hidden.","suite":"Suite","tests":"Tests","passed":"Passed","failed":"Failed","status":"Status","green":"Green","red":"Red","guardrail":"guardrail_check at pack time","ok":"OK","fail":"Violations"},"terminal":{"title":"Guardrail feed","description":"Live BioethicsSupervisor events (no message text, no genes), next to the gate probe.","pack":"pack","live":"live","connecting":"connecting to {api}","offline":"backend not reachable at {api}; feed paused, retrying","empty":"no gate events yet; run a probe or use the citizen app","count":"{n} live events","packTests":"{suite}: {passed}/{tests} passed","packFailed":"{suite}: {failed} of {tests} failed (reported, not hidden)","packGuard":"guardrail_check: {status}","packFeed":"pack run gate events: {passed} passed, {blocked} blocked, {rewritten} rewritten, {escalated} escalated","highlight":"your probe","region":"Guardrail terminal feed","liveBadge":"Live","pausedBadge":"Paused"},"probe":{"title":"Gate probe","description":"Type a draft and pick a recipient. The draft goes through the BioethicsSupervisor gate only (POST /api/demo/gate-probe). Nothing is ever sent to anyone.","draft":"Draft message","draftHelp":"Free text. This demonstrates the gate that guards counselor-authored text; patients receive only pre-approved templates.","recipient":"Recipient (synthetic partner)","recipientOption":"{id} · vignette {v}, partner {role}","lang":"Draft language","en":"English","ar":"Arabic","submit":"Run through the gate","running":"Checking"